      <activity id="c419aa99-c97b-5741-b684-2c09bd98f9e3" activityNameId="8cc0aa04-9cbd-54d1-a3b9-b7b2b55da2c9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Resistor, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Resistor, unspecified, at plant
This module represents an unweighted average of all specific resistors (and the potentiometer) datasets represented in the ecoinvent database. No detailed market share data was found in 2023; UUID: 07c77701-7469-3d22-9853-9ca6d1f1ec0b
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of current resistors.
Location: Data represent global valuable composition data for resistors.
Technology: Average technology for the production of resistors and potentiometers - comprising terminmation printing; resistive body printing; glass coat printing; laser trimming; substrate stripping (SMT) resp. ceramic rods; deposition processes; ageing; capping (THT) resp. printing; curing; punching; revetting; molding (ptoentiom.)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and General Comments
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_07c77701-7469-3d22-9853-9ca6d1f1ec0b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
